<h1 class="pageheading">Publications</h1>
<div class="pagecontent">
    <div class="paradiv">         
        <h4 class="center"><strong><u>SCI-INDEXED Journals&nbsp; &ndash; [13]</u></strong></h4>
        <ol>
            <li>Waqas Ahmed, Muhammad Haroon Yousaf, Amanullah Yasin <strong>&ldquo;Robust Suspicious Action Recognition Approach using Pose Descriptor&rdquo; <u>Published</u></strong> in Mathematical Problems in Engineering. <strong>(IF: 1.305)</strong></li>
            <li>Abdul Nasir, Muhammad Obaid Ullah, Muhammad Haroon Yousaf, Muhammad Asif Aziz <strong>&ldquo;Acquisition of 3-D trajectories with labeling support for multi-species insects under unconstrained flying conditions&rdquo; <u>Published</u></strong> in Ecological Informatics. <strong>(IF: 3.142)</strong></li>
            <li>Hajra Bint-e-Naeem, Fiza Murtaza, Muhammad Haroon Yousaf,&nbsp;Sergio A. Velastin <strong>&ldquo;T-VLAD: Temporal Vector of Locally Aggregated Descriptor for Multiview Human Action Recognition&rdquo;</strong> <strong><u>Published</u></strong> in Pattern Recognition Letters. <strong>(IF: 3.55)</strong></li>
            <li>Yusra Khalid Bhatti, Afshan Jamil, Nudrat Nida, Muhammad Haroon Yousaf, Serestina Viriri, Sergio A. Velastin <strong>&ldquo;Facial Expression Recognition of Instructor Using Deep Features and Extreme Learning Machine&rdquo; <u>Published</u></strong> in Computational Intelligence and Neuroscience. <strong>(IF: 2.284)</strong></li>
            <li>Nudrat Nida, Muhammad Haroon Yousaf, Aun Irtaza, Sergio A. Velastin <strong>&ldquo;A video augmentation technique for human action recognition based on genetic algorithm&rdquo; <u>Published</u></strong> in ETRI Journal. <strong>(IF: 1.094)</strong></li>
            <li>Saqib Umer, Hassan Dawood, Muhammad Haroon Yousaf, Hussain Dawood, Haseeb Ahmed <strong>&ldquo;Efficient foreground object segmentation from video by Probability Weighted Moments&rdquo; <u>Published</u></strong> in OptiK, Volume 229, March 2021, 166251. <strong>(IF: 2.187)</strong></li>
            <li>Malik Ali Gul, Muhammad Haroon Yousaf, Shah Nawaz, Zaka Ur Rehman, HyungWon Kim <strong>&ldquo;Patient Monitoring by Abnormal Human Activity Recognition Based on CNN Architecture&rdquo; <u>Published</u></strong> in Electronics, 2020, 9, 1993. <strong>(IF: 2.412)</strong></li>
            <li>Adeeba Kausar, Afshan Jamil, Nudrat Nida, Muhammad Haroon Yousaf <strong>&ldquo;Two-Wheeled Vehicle Detection using Two-Step and Single-Step Deep Learning Models&rdquo;</strong> <strong><u>Published</u></strong> in Arabian Journal of Science and Engineering 2020. <strong>(IF: 1.518)</strong></li>
            <li>Ammar Mohsin Butt, Muhammad Haroon Yousaf, Fiza Murtaza, Saima Nazir, Serestina Viriri, Sergio A. Velastin, &ldquo;<strong>Agglomerative Clustering and Residual-VLAD Encoding for Human Action Recognition&rdquo;</strong> <strong><u>Published</u></strong> in Applied Sciences, Vol 10, 04412, June 2020 <strong>(IF: 2.217)</strong>.</li>
            <li>Fiza Murtaza, Muhammad Haroon Yousaf, Sergio A. Velastin, Yu Qian &ldquo;<strong>Vectors of Temporally Correlated Snippets for Temporal Action Detection&rdquo;</strong> <strong><u>Published</u></strong> in Computers and Electrical Engineering, Volume 85, May 2020 <a href="https://doi.org/10.1016/j.compeleceng.2020.106654">https://doi.org/10.1016/j.compeleceng.2020.106654</a> <strong>(IF: 2.189)</strong>.</li>
            <li>Hajra Bint-e-Naeem, Fiza Murtaza, Muhammad Haroon Yousaf,&nbsp;Sergio A. Velastin <strong>&ldquo;Multiple batches of motion history images (MB-MHIs) for multiview human action recognition&rdquo;</strong> <strong><u>Published</u></strong> in Arabian Journal of Science and Engineering, DOI: 10.1007/s13369-020-04481-y 2020. <strong>(IF: 1.518)</strong></li>
            <li>Adeel Ahmed Jamil, Fawad Hussain, Muhammad Haroon Yousaf, Ammar Mohsin Butt, Sergio A. Velastin &ldquo;<strong>Vehicle Make and Model Recognition Using Bag of Expressions&rdquo;</strong> <strong><u>Published</u></strong> in Sensors, Vol. 20, No. 4, 1033, (2019) <strong>(IF: 3.0)</strong>.</li>
            <li>Nudrat Nida, Muhammad Haroon Yousaf, Aun Irtaza, Sergio A. Velastin <strong>&ldquo;Deep temporal motion descriptor (DTMD) for human action recognition&rdquo; <u>Published</u></strong> in Turkish Journal of Electrical Engineering and Computer Science, DOI:10.3906/elk-1907-214 2019. <strong>(IF: 0.625)</strong></li>
        </ol>
        <h4><strong><u>International Conferences / Journals &ndash; [08]</u></strong></h4>
        <ol>
            <li>Muhammad Saad Saeed, Muhammad Haris Khan, Shah Nawaz, Muhammad Haroon Yousaf, Alessio Del Bue &ldquo;<strong>Fusion And Orthogonal Projection for Improved Face-Voice Association</strong>&rdquo; <strong><u>Accepted</u></strong> in 2022 IEEE International Conference on Acoustics, Speech and Signal Processing (ICASSP).</li>
            <li>Muhammad Ahmed Raza, Hajra Binte-Naeem, Muhammad Haroon Yousaf, Amanullah Yasin <strong>&ldquo;BirdView Retina-Net: Small-Scale Object Detector for Unmanned Aerial Vehicles)&rdquo;</strong> <strong><u>Presented Presentation</u></strong> in 16<sup>th</sup> International Conference on Emerging Technologies (ICET), Islamabad Pakistan 2021.<strong> (BEST PAPER AWARD in the Professional Category)</strong></li>
            <li>Zubair Saeed, Ali Raza, Ans Hussain Qureshi, Muhammad Haroon Yousaf <strong>&ldquo;A Generic Multi-Crop Disease Detection and Classification Approach using CNN&rdquo;</strong> <strong><u>Published</u></strong> in Proceedings of 4<sup>th</sup> International Conference on Robotics and Automation in Industry (ICRAI), Islamabad Pakistan 2021.</li>
            <li>Arslan Ali, Muhammad Muzamal Shahzad, Ans Hussain Qureshi, Mansoor Shaukat, Muhammad Haroon Yousaf <strong>&ldquo;A Decentralized Pattern Formation and Navigation Approach For Swarms: Multi-UAV Perspective&rdquo;</strong> <strong><u>Published</u></strong> in Proceedings of 4<sup>th</sup> International Conference on Robotics and Automation in Industry (ICRAI), Islamabad Pakistan 2021.</li>
            <li>Mishal Fatima, Muhammad Haroon Yousaf, Amanullah Yasin, Sergio Velastin <strong>&ldquo;Unsupervised Fall Detection Approach Using Human Skeletons&rdquo;</strong> <strong><u>Published</u></strong> in Proceedings of 4<sup>th</sup> International Conference on Robotics and Automation in Industry (ICRAI), Islamabad Pakistan 2021.</li>
            <li>Shahzeb Ahsan, Saran Khaliq, M. Danish Nisar <strong>&ldquo;Multi-Platform Hardware In The Loop (HIL) Simulation for Decentralized Swarm Communication Using ROS and GAZEBO&rdquo;</strong> <strong><u>Published</u></strong> in IEEE SwarmNet 2021.</li>
            <li>Hajra Binte Naeem, Muhammad Haroon Yousaf, Farhan Hassan Khan, Amanullah Yasin &ldquo;<strong>Vision-Based Real-time Human Malicious Behavior Detection</strong>&rdquo; <strong>Accepted</strong> in International Conference on Artificial Intelligence 2021, Pakistan.</li>
            <li>Umber Saba, Fiza Murtaza, Muhammad Haroon Yousaf, Serestina Viriri &ldquo;<strong>Plant Species Identification using Discriminant Bag of Words (DBoW)&rdquo;</strong> Published in VISAPP - 15th International Conference on Computer Vision Theory and Applications, Valletta, Malta (2020).</li>
        </ol>
        <h4 class="center"><strong><u>RESEARCH GRANTS</u></strong></h4>
        <ol>
            <li><strong>Finalist OPENCV AI Competition 2021</strong> by Intel/OPENCV. Worth 3498 US$.</li>
            <li><strong>Winner</strong>, Robotics and Automation Startup Challenge 2021, worth 0.3 Mn. PKR.</li>
            <li><strong>Joint Project</strong> &ldquo;IntelliSurv&rdquo; funded by SinoPak Centre for Artificial Intelligence (SPCAI), PAF-IAST 2021.</li>
            <li>Research grant of 2,00,000 Rs. for Research Academia Collaboration for year 2021 by NESCOM Pakistan.</li>
            <li>Research grant of 2,50,000 Rs. for Research Academia Collaboration for year 2021 by NESCOM Pakistan.</li>
            <li>Research grant of 2,00,000 Rs. for Research Academia Collaboration for year 2020 by NESCOM Pakistan.</li>
            <li>Research grant of 1,50,000 Rs. for Research Academia Collaboration for year 2020 by NESCOM Pakistan.</li>
            <li>Research grant of 1,00,000 Rs. for Research Academia Collaboration for year 2019 by NESCOM Pakistan.</li>
            <li>Research grant of 1,00,000 Rs. for Research Academia Collaboration for year 2019 by NESCOM Pakistan.</li>
        </ol>
       
